  "solution": "Given equation: (60 ÷ 2) × 3 - 100 + 400 = 560\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 400 and 60\n\nGiven: (60 ÷ 2) × 3 - 100 + 400 = 560\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**(400 ÷ 2)**__ × 3 - 100 + 60 = 560\n\n⇒ __**200 × 3**__ - 100 + 60 = 560\n\n⇒ __**600**__ - 100 __**+ 60**__ = 560\n\n⇒ __660** - 100**__ = 560\n\n⇒ **560 = 560**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) 60 and 100\n\nGiven: (60 ÷ 2) × 3 - 100 + 400 = 560\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**10**____**0 ÷ 2**__) × 3 - 60 + 400 = 560\n\n⇒ __**50 × 3**__ - 60 + 400 = 560\n\n⇒ __**1**____**50**__ - 60 __**+ 400**__ = 560\n\n⇒ __550 -____ 60__ = 560\n\n⇒ 490 ≠ 560\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 400 and 560\n\nGiven: (60 ÷ 2) × 3 - 100 + 400 = 560\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**60 ÷ 2**__) × 3 - 100 + 560 = 400\n\n⇒ __**30 × 3**__ - 100 + 560 = 400\n\n⇒ __**90**__ - 100 __**+ 560**__ = 400\n\n⇒ __650** - 100**__ = 400\n\n⇒ 550 ≠ 400\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 100 and 560\n\nGiven: (60 ÷ 2) × 3 - 100 + 400 = 560\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**60 ÷ 2**__) × 3 - 560 + 400 = 100\n\n⇒ __**30**____** × 3**__ - 560 + 400 = 100\n\n⇒ __**90**__ - 560 __**+ 400**__ = 100\n\n⇒ __490** - 560**__ = 100\n\n⇒ -70 ≠ 100\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
